  Private Key Alias (ET) :
  -> Enter an alias to select the private key from the keystore.
     You can specify that the alias is read dynamically from a message header; for example, if you specify
     ${header.abc} then the alias value is read from the header with the name "abc“. You can also specify
     that the alias is read dynamically from an exchange property; for example, if you specify
     ${property.abc} then alias is read from the property with the name “abc”.

Signature Algorithm (DD) :
-> Select a signature algorithm for the RSA or DSA private key type.

   Supported algorithms for content signing (digest and encryption algorithm): MD5/RSA, MD2/RSA,
   RIPEMD160andMGF1/RSA-ISO9796-2-2-3, RIPEMD128/RSA, RIPEMD160/RSA, RIPEMD256/RSA, SHA/RSA,
